<h2 class="doc-h2">Sizes</h2>
<p class="doc-note">Sizes read <code>--control-h</code> and <code>--control-text</code> rather than shadcn's literal <code>h-9 text-sm</code>, which is the only reason one library can dress a 46px storefront and a 36px back office.</p>
